      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would indicate your Steam account is not trusted. Nothing related to vrchat. I don’t have the links right now but you need to meet steams requirements to be trusted which lets you use all of steams features. \nIf you do have a trusted steam account you can still purchase vrc+ there as it will tie it to the current logged in vrc account. Once paid for on a trusted steam account you can launch vrc from anywhere again without issues.",
