      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ff7a13292f6e94ce6855230|full_name}: Here is the Limited User Accounts support page: https://support.steampowered.com/kb_article.php?ref=3330-IAGK-7663\nThere is similar information on the Trading and Market Restrictions support page that points to needing a purchase on your account. So as long as you meet the requirements for the Limited User Accounts page, that should lift the restrictions from the account.\nEDIT: I should probably point out that I made the assumption your account was in a limited state due to being a new account but failed to mention that if your account has anything else that may cause it to be restricted, such as a VAC ban, you will need to find another way to resolve that. If you are only having this problem due to it being a new steam account then the requirements on the support page should fix the trusted issue.",
